{"label": "b48039a39f963ed385fd", "speaker_changes_inside": "no", "view": "question", "referents": [{"word": "me", "refers_to": "the guest, Leon Wankum, as a business operator", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}, {"word": "it", "refers_to": "accumulating Bitcoin (dummy it in 'making it difficult')", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}], "conditions": [], "retraction": "none", "time_ok": "yes", "proposition": "The guest asks how he, as a business operator, can accumulate Bitcoin the fastest without regulation making it difficult for him.", "certainty": "certain", "speaker_is": "guest", "speaker_evidence": "When I when you ask me as a business operator, what what do you do? What's your goal? ›› Number one, surely it's to provide housing, but number two, it's to accumulate Bitcoin."},
{"label": "bacb2f01f3a6e5f57a70", "speaker_changes_inside": "no", "view": "reading_aloud", "referents": [], "conditions": [], "retraction": "none", "time_ok": "yes", "proposition": "Bitcoin's spot price fell below $70,000 on Friday, its lowest level since August.", "certainty": "certain", "speaker_is": "host", "speaker_evidence": "What is up everybody? Happy Friday and welcome to the show."},
